            "pc_requirements": {
                "minimum": "<strong>Mínimos:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requer um sistema operativo e processador de 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / Intel Core i3-9100F / AMD FX-6300 / AMD Ryzen 3 3200G<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 760 / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 / AMD Radeon R7 260x / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 11<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 52 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectSound<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> - These specs allow for the game to be played in 1080p/30fps with graphics settings at &quot;Low&quot;. - 64-bit processor and operating system are required.</li></ul>",
                "recommended": "<strong>Recomendados:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requer um sistema operativo e processador de 64 bits<br></li><li><strong>Sistema Operativo:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) / Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processador:</strong> Intel Core i7-3770 / Intel Core i3-8350 / Intel Core i3-9350F / AMD Ryzen 5 1500X / AMD Ryzen 5 3400G<br></li><li><strong>Memória:</strong> 8 GB de RAM<br></li><li><strong>Placa gráfica:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (VRAM 3GB) / NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1650 / AMD Radeon RX 480 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Versão 12<br></li><li><strong>Rede:</strong> Ligação à Internet de banda larga<br></li><li><strong>Espaço no disco:</strong> Requer 52 GB de espaço livre<br></li><li><strong>Placa de som:</strong> DirectSound<br></li><li><strong>Notas adicionais:</strong> - These specs allow for the game to be played in 1080p/30fps with graphics settings at &quot;High&quot;. - 64-bit processor and operating system are required. - Windows 10 (Version 1809 or later) and a 4GB VRAM GPU (graphics board or video card) are required for DirectX 12 API. ※ If you are using Windows 11, please ensure that your system meets the Windows 11 system requirements.</li></ul>"
            },
